{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他肯让想靠近的念头留下来，亲近对方的快乐又回来了。\",\n      \"key\": \"快乐又回来\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想被珍惜时，仍记得自己真心替对方高兴过，不再把先前的体贴看成讨回报，心里有些满足。\",\n      \"key\": \"讨回报\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"text\": \"犹疑了这么久，他竟还会因为喜欢而高兴，心里有些感动。\",\n      \"key\": \"有些感动\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道对方没给新的保证，高兴时仍怕落空，却还是愿意好好享受这份喜欢。\",\n      \"key\": \"好好享受\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R47\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不再压住渴望后重新尝到亲近之乐，避免写成毫无变化地回到最初。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R48\", \"R49\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-2\", \"S11-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩并补回\",\n      \"why\": \"不再罗列旧经历。由S08-2说明先前的体贴确有真心，S09-1保留想被珍惜的愿望，并补回犹疑许久仍能高兴、因此感动的层次。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R50\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去重复的回应不由他决定，改由S10-1回指仍无保证、S08-5回指怕亲近转眼过去；保留他明知可能落空，仍愿意享受这份喜欢。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"若满足指对方终于回应了他，前文没有这样的事实，不能由线补出。此刻能解释的是他暂时允许自己享受幸福，不能据此认定长期期待已在两人的关系中得到满足。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6561533c-b6f8-44c4-8c01-ac69400eec1a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T102508887121Z", "elapsed_seconds": 918.906, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T10:40:27.799046+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1380d9b9fd282209136ecb407ce34a13ade1e534ab1f81ed5ba134cab1de767e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f45828